stateDiagram-v2
    title Máquina de Estados — Chromosome

    [*] --> classified : EfficientNet-B3\nassigna par + score

    classified --> needs_review : score < 0.85\nrequires_review = true
    classified --> auto_accepted : score >= 0.85\nborde verde

    needs_review --> under_edit : Analista abre\ncromosoma naranja
    needs_review --> xai_viewed : Analista activa\nGrad-CAM saliency map

    xai_viewed --> under_edit : Analista decide\neditar
    xai_viewed --> validated : Analista acepta\nclasificación IA

    under_edit --> validated : PATCH /validated\n+ registro en edits

    auto_accepted --> random_audit : Selección aleatoria\n5% por supervisor
    auto_accepted --> validated : Validación implícita\n(no requiere acción)

    random_audit --> validated : Supervisor aprueba
    random_audit --> under_edit : Supervisor detecta\nerror — devuelve

    validated --> [*] : Contribuye al\ndesbloqueo de informe

    note right of needs_review
        Bloquea exportación\nde informe
    end note

    note right of xai_viewed
        Log obligatorio:\nXAI_VIEWED en audit trail
    end note
